N2  - The proceedings contain 20 papers. The topics discussed include: efficacy and safety of CT-P13 (infliximab biosimilar) over two years in patients with rheumatoid arthritis: comparison between continued CT-P13 and switching from infliximab to CT-P13; proteome-wide analysis and CXCL4 as a pathogenic biomarker in systemic sclerosis; a phase 2b, 12-week study of VX-509, an oral selective Janus kinase 3 inhibitor, in combination with background methotrexate in rheumatoid arthritis; apremilast in the treatment of DMARD-naïve psoriatic arthritis patients: results of a phase 3 randomized, controlled trial (PALACE 4); improvement in high density lipoprotein function in early rheumatoid arthritis patients treated with methotrexate monotherapy or combination therapy in the treatment of early rheumatoid arthritis trial; and efficacy and safety of pregabalin in patients with fibromyalgia and co-morbid depression receiving concurrent antidepressant therapy: a randomized, 2-way crossover, double-blind, placebo-controlled study.
